.com/docs/access?context=hla-data-input-setup-manual&family=yokohama&ft:locale=en-US","line":118},{"title":"Configure log data integrations from the Integrations Launchpad","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=hla-data-input-setup-integrations&family=yokohama&ft:locale=en-US","line":122},{"title":"Set up an Amazon Data Firehose integration for real-time log data streaming from multiple sources","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=il-connector-hla-firehose&family=yokohama&ft:locale=en-US","line":126},{"title":"Facilitate Cribl log data ingestion by Health Log Analytics using the Cribl integration","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=il-connector-hla-cribl&family=zurich&ft:locale=en-US","line":137},{"title":"Leverage additional information available on the integration's Overview screen","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=il-connector-overview-tab&family=zurich&ft:locale=en-US","line":142},{"title":"Export source types to an update set by log source","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=hla-export-sourcetypes-by-source&family=zurich&ft:locale=en-US","line":147},{"title":"Map log data to service instances and components for alerts in context","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=il-connector-hla-map-business-context&family=zurich&ft:locale=en-US","line":152},{"title":"Display Integrations Launchpad from the ITOM AIOps configuration center","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=itom-aiops-conf-center&family=zurich&ft:locale=en-US","line":157},{"title":"Set up a GCP PubSub integration from the Integrations Launchpad","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=il-connector-hla-gcp-pubsub&family=zurich&ft:locale=en-US","line":162},{"title":"Set up a Microsoft Azure Event Hubs integration from the Integrations Launchpad","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=il-connector-hla-event-hubs&family=zurich&ft